@startuml
[*] --> Start

state Start {
  [*] --> ReceiveRequest : receive video suggestion request
}

ReceiveRequest --> IdentifyUser : identify user

IdentifyUser --> GatherVideos : gather videos based on profile, trends, tags, genres, and promotions

GatherVideos --> EnhanceDetails : add thumbnails and view counts

EnhanceDetails --> SendSuggestions : send suggested videos to user

SendSuggestions --> [*] : back to start
@enduml
